+        <h2>Seven Levels Agentic Prompt Formats</h2>
+        <p class="chapter-feature__dek">Build reusable prompts from thirteen composable sections, climb seven capability levels, and choose the lowest format that can reliably carry the work.</p>
+        <ul class="chapter-feature__meta"><li>Agentic Horizon · Prompt engineering</li><li>60–90 min lab</li><li>12 full-width course frames</li><li>2 current-practice overlays</li></ul>
