     <article class="chapter-feature">
       <div class="chapter-feature__copy">
-        <p class="eyebrow">Now available · Volume I · Chapter 08</p>
-        <h2>The Agentic Layer</h2>
-        <p class="chapter-feature__dek">Separate the application from the ring that operates it, build the three-directory minimum, compose prompt contracts into ADWs, and scale through task boards, triggers, isolated agents, and measured autonomy.</p>
